  "description": "A fast, attribute-driven micro-ORM for SQL Server, MySQL and PostgreSQL (through the cl2j.Database.SqlServer, cl2j.Database.MySql and cl2j.Database.PostgreSql provider packages): describe a table with a plain class and get CRUD, queries by key or by example, generated string keys, JSON columns, bulk insert and table creation, all derived from the class. Dapper-level speed, no DbContext, a fraction of EF Core's memory.",
